  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.14:\n- A Slider or Stepper overwrote its bound Value when it got its handler\n- Startup no longer creates the GTK host window or loads the GTK theme CSS\n- The system theme watcher no longer watches all of `~/.config`\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
